OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order over 'fireworks
OL,4,Athrown at vehicles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order covering part of
OL,7,FMerseyside has been introduced by
OL,8,Fpolice following reports of teenagers
OL,9,Fthrowing fireworks at vehicles.
OL,11,FThe order, covering parts of St Helens
OL,12,Fand Rainhill, came into force at 23:30
OL,13,FBST on Saturday and runs until 05:00 on
OL,14,FMonday, Merseyside Police said.
OL,16,FInsp Neil Taylor said: "This order is
OL,17,Fin response to reports of youths
OL,18,Fcausing anti-social behaviour,
OL,19,Fincluding throwing fireworks at
OL,20,Fvehicles and cycling in an anti-social
OL,21,Fmanner."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
